From 637186e35a6a6ac9c10ffeb062e68f417b719eb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JimmyBlunt <jo@paso-music.de>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:15:39 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] Add "New FastLED pattern" and FastLED-aware header,
 deck, lens (local #9002)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Patterns rail "Add pattern" menu: New FastLED pattern creates "Untitled
  FastLED Pattern" from the starter template through the same create/open
  path as a Pixelblaze Pattern (autosave, rename, delete unchanged).
- Editor header and preview title show a "FastLED · nD" pill
  (PatternDimPills) instead of render-function dimensions.
- Preview deck: the renderer cell shows "FastLED" instead of the
  Fast/Precise select (FastLED Patterns always render natively).
- Rail dimension lens uses @pxlblz-dim for FastLED Patterns.
- Copy code copies the raw C++ (there is no Pixelblaze artifact);
  Download .epe is hidden and guarded for FastLED Patterns.

Pre-commit hook checks run manually (hook cannot spawn npx.cmd on Windows/Node 24):
npm run lint, check:e2e-coverage, check:e2e-locators, tsc -b (tsconfig + node),
vitest PatternList + rail + dimLens (all passed), PreviewDeck (34 passed,
2 pre-existing off-ladder failures as on upstream).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
